      "text": "Two years ago, the Titan submersible tragedy claimed five lives and gripped the world.\n\nA formal Marine Board of Investigation was initiated to fully understand what happened. The Coast Guard – along with our international and agency partners – will use those findings to help prevent future tragedies.\n\nAs we continue that work, we honor the five lives lost and extend our thoughts to their loved ones.\n\nThe Coast Guard’s priority was—and remains—ensuring safety at sea, both above and below the surface.\n#uscg  #Titan  #MaritimeSafety #SearchAndRescue\n@USCGLANTAREA",
      "text_resolved": "Two years ago, the Titan submersible tragedy claimed five lives and gripped the world.\n\nA formal Marine Board of Investigation was initiated to fully understand what happened. The Coast Guard – along with our international and agency partners – will use those findings to help prevent future tragedies.\n\nAs we continue that work, we honor the five lives lost and extend our thoughts to their loved ones.\n\nThe Coast Guard’s priority was—and remains—ensuring safety at sea, both above and below the surface.\n#uscg  #Titan  #MaritimeSafety #SearchAndRescue\n@USCGLANTAREA",
