      "text": "Happy Birthday to our U.S. Coast Guard Auxiliary! We celebrate 86 years of dedicated service from our incredible Auxiliary. Their unwavering commitment to boating safety, search and rescue assistance, and support of our missions keeps Americans safe every single day. Thank you, Auxiliary, for being a critical part of America’s finest and most dedicated military service!  If you’re a U.S. citizen, 17 years of age or older, consider joining an Auxiliary flotilla! No experience necessary, and training is provided. https://t.co/XCNfoTAfK6\n@USCGAux #uscg",
